source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_L\\)</span> (free-variable set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-sentences, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L:\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)=\\emptyset\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This set-valued presentation is compatible with the sentence predicate in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"li