3cb1dd7ec8d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ and sentence truth are from [[17-df-sentence]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]]."},{"id":"401bc4f750ae4719","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ ($T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"82293682c9179b16","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ 及总字母表 $\\Sigma_L$ 见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]；$\\mathfrak A=(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。对每个 $a\\in|\\mathfrak A|$，令 $c_a=\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)$，其中 $\\operatorname{Name}_L$ 是 [[17-df-language-constants]] 中已定义的规范新名字函数。$L(C)$ 取 [[17-df-language-constants]] 的常元扩张，$\\upharpoonright L$ 取 [[17-df-reduct]] 的语言约化。原子公式集 $\\mathrm{AtomForm}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$、句子集 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak A)}$ 与句子真值 $\\models$ 分别见 [[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-sentence]]、[[17-df-sentence-truth]]。以下定义 $C_{\\mathfrak A}$、$L(\\mathfrak A)$、规范命名扩张 $\\mathfrak A_{\\mathfrak A}$ 和 $\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)$。"},{"id":"b664bed1223db216","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}$ (sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (the set of $L$-sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"1e5b78bfb3887990","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$；$\\mathrm{AtomForm}_L$、$\\mathrm{Form}_L$、$\\mathrm{Var}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-atomic-formula]]、[[17-df-formula]]、[[17-df-first-order-language]]，$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]。有限序列函数 $\\operatorname{Or}_L$、$\\operatorname{And}_L$ 及对象语言的 $\\land,\\exists$ 均采用 [[17-df-symbols]] 的展开定义，不视为未声明的原始语法。"},{"id":"6495b9aaef839e12","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathscr L$ 为 [[17-df-abstract-logic]] 的语义接口，$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$L,L_0,L'\\in\\mathcal V$；子语言、约化、符号重命名及结构拉回见 [[17-df-reduct]]、[[17-df-language-operations]]。普通子结构见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]，一阶句子见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$\\operatorname{Inj}$、有限性见 [[17-df-set-functions]]、[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。$P\\notin\\Sigma_L$ 是新的一元关系符号；$L^P$ 在下式构造，$\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L^P)$ 时 $D_P^{\\mathfrak M}$ 是 $P$ 的元素层解释。下面的每个性质是关于固定接口 $S_{\\mathscr L},E_{\\mathscr L}$ 的形式模式。相对化仅对有限非逻辑符号语言要求；若 $D_P^{\\mathfrak M}$ 为空或不承载原语言的子结构，则其相对化句为假。"},{"id":"b0923b75f2632493","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。"},{"id":"3ed1bbae3ef8ad93","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$（句子集，见 [[17-df-sentence]]）。"},{"id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (sentence, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"de5d3e9530a68ea0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 与完整型空间 $S_n(T)$ 取 [[17-df-type]]。$p$ 是候选公式集。以下定义的 $\\operatorname{Isolated}_T(p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T(p)$ 同时适用于全部有限元数；$n$ 在定义式内局部绑定，不是调用处隐藏的自由参数。"},{"id":"7820ef81342beb1d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ ($L$-sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"9e252481051482c9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}$ (sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"e318e28bff8754a3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ ($T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"2024ee60951aa39e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeVar}$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\mathrm{QFForm}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-free-variable]]、[[17-df-sentence]]、[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]。$\\operatorname{All}_L$、$\\operatorname{Exists}_L$ 取 [[17-df-symbols]] 的量词块函数，包括空序列输入。$\\mathrm{ExForm}_{L,n},\\mathrm{ExSent}_L,\\mathrm{ForallExistsSent}_L$ 在下式定义。"},{"id":"3979795456a966f2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (class of $L$-sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"f04efe137662255b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ (the set of $L$-sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma$ ($\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"fe3b669b17d273d8","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ is a first-order language with components from [[17-df-first-order-language]], and $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ as in [[17-df-sentence]]."},{"id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ ($T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ ($T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$, see [[17-df-sentence]])"},{"id":"262cf6e0c0418727","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2